Package: live-kernel-updater
Architecture: all
Depends: cli-shell-utils, file, sbsigntool, uc-tool-mx
Description: This is a command line program that updates the kernel on a antiX or MX
 live-usb. It can update a running live-usb or a live-usb that is plugged
 into a host system.
